! QED arm: FSR + ISR -- photon radiation off both lepton legs.
!
! MUON ONLY.  Initial-state radiation off the lepton line needs a charged
! incoming lepton; the charged current starts from a neutrino and has no
! counterpart.  run_powheg_shower.sh refuses this arm for --current nu rather
! than silently producing a duplicate of `fsr`.
!
! ISR changes the energy actually entering the hard scattering, so unlike FSR
! it moves the true kinematics and not only the reconstructed ones.
TimeShower:QEDshowerByL = on
SpaceShower:QEDshowerByL = on
